ay.zipModifyStride\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">zipModifyStride</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">sa </span><span class=\"fn\">sb</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride\">Stride</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f </span><span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">_ha</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">sa</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride.Fits\">Fits</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">_hb</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">sb</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride.Fits\">Fits</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The arrays `a` and `b` with, at each of the first `n` steps `i` of the strides `sa`, which fits in\n`a`, and `sb`, which fits in `b`, `f u v` written at `sa.idx i` in `a` and `g u v` at `sb.idx i`\nin `b`, where `u` and `v` are the elements there: the model\n`zipModifyAt a b sa.idx sb.idx 0 n (fun _ => f) (fun _ => g)`, run as one loop, such as a plane\nrotation of two vectors. `a` and `b` may be the same array: the model treats them as two arrays,\nand so does the loop, which then copies one of them.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyStride","kind":"def","line":1037,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyStride","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L1037-L1048"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyStride2_eq_modifyStride2Impl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">modifyStride2_eq_modifyStride2Impl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyStride2\">modifyStride2</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyStride2Impl\">modifyStride2Impl</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyStride2_eq_modifyStride2Impl","kind":"theorem","line":1019,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyStride2_eq_modifyStride2Impl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L1019-L1035"}},{"header"