2/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyAt\">zipModifyAt</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <span class=\"fn\">ia</span> <span class=\"fn\">ib</span> <span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">hi</span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">g</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size_zipModifyAt_fst","kind":"theorem","line":437,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.size_zipModifyAt_fst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L437-L440"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyAt\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">zipModifyAt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ia </span><span class=\"fn\">ib</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">hi</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f </span><span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The arrays `a` and `b` where, for each `i` from `lo` up to `hi - 1`, in this order,\n`u := a[ia i]!` and `v := b[ib i]!` are read, and then `f i u v` is written at the index `ia i` of\n`a` and `g i u v` at the index `ib i` of `b`, where each step sees the earlier writes. Indices out\nof bounds read `default` and are not written. It is the model of a loop that updates two arrays\ntogether, such as a plane rotation of two vectors. When the two index maps are injective on the\nrange, `zipModifyAt_eq` gives it as a `modifyAt` of each array.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyAt","kind":"def","line":418,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.zipModifyAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L418-L428"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyAt2_eq\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">modifyAt2_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span cla