>lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">hi</span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">g</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size_modifyAt2","kind":"theorem","line":332,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.size_modifyAt2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L332-L335"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyAt2\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">modifyAt2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ia </span><span class=\"fn\">ib</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">hi</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f </span><span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The array `a` where, for each `i` from `lo` up to `hi - 1`, in this order, `u := a[ia i]!` and\n`v := a[ib i]!` are read, and then `f i u v` is written at the index `ia i` and `g i u v` at the\nindex `ib i`, where each step sees the earlier writes. Indices out of bounds read `default` and are\nnot written. It is the model of a loop that updates two strides of one array together, such as a\nplane rotation of two rows of a matrix. When the two index maps are injective on the range and\nnever meet, `modifyAt2_eq` gives it as two `modifyAt`s.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyAt2","kind":"def","line":320,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyAt2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L320-L330"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.copySlice_eq_modifyAt\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">copySlice_eq_modifyAt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">dest</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">destOff </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exact</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₁</span> : <span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">src</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₂</span> : <span class=\"fn\">destOff</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">dest</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.size\">size</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">src</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.copySlice\">copySlice</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> <span class=\"fn\">dest</span> <span class=\"fn\">destOff</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <span class=\"fn\">exact</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">dest</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.modifyAt\">modifyAt</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">destOff</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int32\">Int32</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">src</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem!\">[</a><span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem!\">]</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem!\">!</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`copySlice` within bounds writes the elements of `src` at the indices `destOff + i`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.copySlice_eq_modifyAt","kind":"theorem","line":233,"name":"ScalarArray.Int32Array.copySlice_eq_modifyAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.lean#L233-L254"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array.getElem_modifyAt_stride\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">getElem_modifyAt_stride</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int32Array\">Int32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride\">Stride</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride.Fits\">Fits</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.I